0.0625rem; text-decoration-skip-ink: auto; word-break: break-word; box-sizing: inherit; text-underline-offset: 0.08em;&quot;&gt;25&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;to predict the expression of 40 protein biomarkers simultaneously based on H&amp;amp;E images&lt;/span&gt;" link="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;HEX was trained by leveraging state-of-the-art pathology foundation models&lt;/span&gt;&lt;sup style=&quot;vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 0; position: relative; top: -0.5em; box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;a data-track=&quot;click&quot; data-track-action=&quot;reference anchor&quot; data-track-label=&quot;link&quot; data-test=&quot;citation-ref&quot; title=&quot;Xiang, J. et al. A vision–language foundation model for precision oncology. Nature 638, 769–778 (2025).&quot; href=&quot;https://www.nature.com/articles/s41591-025-04060-4#ref-CR22&quot; id=&quot;ref-link-section-d38724318e692&quot; style=&quot;vertical-align: baseline; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 102, 153); overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: underline 0.0625rem; text-decoration-skip-ink: auto; word-break: break-word; box-sizing: inherit; text-underline-offset: 0.08em;&quot;&gt;22&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a data-track=&quot;click&quot; data-track-action=&quot;reference anchor&quot; data-track-label=&quot;link&quot; data-test=&quot;citation-ref&quot; title=&quot;Vorontsov, E. et al. A foundation model for clinical-grade computational pathology and rare cancers detection. Nat. Med. 30, 2924–2935 (2024).&quot; href=&quot;https://www.nature.com/articles/s41591-025-04060-4#ref-CR23&quot; id=&quot;ref-link-section-d38724318e692_1&quot; style=&quot;vertical-align: baseline; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 102, 153); overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: underline 0.0625rem; text-decoration-skip-ink: auto; word-break: break-word; box-sizing: inherit; text-underline-offset: 0.08em;&quot;&gt;23&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a data-track=&quot;click&quot; data-track-action=&quot;reference anchor&quot; data-track-label=&quot;link&quot; data-test=&quot;citation-ref&quot; title=&quot;Lu, M. Y. et al. A visual-language foundation model for computational pathology. Nat. Med. 30, 863–874 (2024).&quot; href=&quot;https://www.nature.com/articles/s41591-025-04060-4#ref-CR24&quot; id=&quot;ref-link-section-d38724318e692_2&quot; style=&quot;vertical-align: baseline; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 102, 153); overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: underline 0.0625rem; text-decoration-skip-ink: auto; word-break: break-word; box-sizing: inherit; text-underline-offset: 0.08em;&quot;&gt;24&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a data-track=&quot;click&quot; data-track-action=&quot;reference anchor&quot; data-track-label=&quot;link&quot; data-test=&quot;citation-ref&quot; aria-label=&quot;Reference 25&quot; title=&quot;Chen, R. J. et al. Towards a general-purpose foundation model for computational pathology. Nat. Med. 30, 850–862 (2024).&quot; href=&quot;https://www.nature.com/articles/s41591-025-04060-4#ref-CR25&quot; id=&quot;ref-link-section-d38724318e695&quot; style=&quot;vertical-align: baseline; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 102, 153); overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: underline 0.0625rem; text-decoration-skip-ink: auto; word-break: break-word; box-sizing: inherit; text-underline-offset: 0.08em;&quot;&gt;25&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;to predict the expression of 40 protein biomarkers simultaneously based on H&amp;amp;E images&lt;/span&gt;" id="2DID-G2zERWf9IesuURK-11">
