        <mxCell id="jLvaAgckw38uRxlf_2XB-21" parent="1" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/png,;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="650" width="800" x="-2525" y="1295" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jLvaAgckw38uRxlf_2XB-22" edge="1" parent="1" style="endArrow=none;dashed=1;html=1;rounded=0;strokeWidth=5;" value="">
          <mxGeometry height="50" relative="1" width="50" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="-850" y="2100" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="-855" y="100" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;h3 class=&quot;c-article__sub-heading&quot; id=&quot;Sec8&quot; style=&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.0117156rem; line-height: 1.24; box-sizing: inherit; font-style: normal; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); margin: 24px 0px 8px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 22px;&quot;&gt;Biological interpretation of HEX-based prognosis prediction&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word; box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 24px; margin-top: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 22px;&quot;&gt;Our HEX approach not only enables accurate prognosis prediction but can also provide biological interpretation behind the predictions. Figure&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-track=&quot;click&quot; data-track-label=&quot;link&quot; data-track-action=&quot;figure anchor&quot; href=&quot;https://www.nature.com/articles/s41591-025-04060-4#Fig5&quot; style=&quot;vertical-align: baseline; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 102, 153); overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: underline 0.0625rem; text-decoration-skip-ink: auto; word-break: break-word; box-sizing: inherit; text-underline-offset: 0.08em;&quot;&gt;5a&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;shows the virtual spatial proteomics profiles generated from standard H&amp;amp;E images for selected key biomarkers that correspond to model-predicted high- and low-risk patients. This allows us to link tissue morphology with spatially resolved protein expression and pinpoint regions of interest that contribute most strongly to patient risk.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" link="&lt;h3 class=&quot;c-article__sub-heading&quot; id=&quot;Sec8&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 400; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.0117156rem; font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.24; box-sizing: inherit; font-style: normal; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); margin: 24px 0px 8px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Biological interpretation of HEX-based prognosis prediction&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word; box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 24px; margin-top: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Our HEX approach not only enables accurate prognosis prediction but can also provide biological interpretation behind the predictions. Figure&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a data-track=&quot;click&quot; data-track-label=&quot;link&quot; data-track-action=&quot;figure anchor&quot; href=&quot;https://www.nature.com/articles/s41591-025-04060-4#Fig5&quot; style=&quot;vertical-align: baseline; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 102, 153); overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: underline 0.0625rem; text-decoration-skip-ink: auto; word-break: break-word; box-sizing: inherit; text-underline-offset: 0.08em;&quot;&gt;5a&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;shows the virtual spatial proteomics profiles generated from standard H&amp;amp;E images for selected key biomarkers that correspond to model-predicted high- and low-risk patients. This allows us to link tissue morphology with spatially resolved protein expression and pinpoint regions of interest that contribute most strongly to patient risk.&lt;/p&gt;" id="jLvaAgckw38uRxlf_2XB-23">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="180" width="780" x="1740" y="430" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="jLvaAgckw38uRxlf_2XB-24" parent="1" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/webp,;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="950" width="739.42" x="1750" y="670" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jLvaAgckw38uRxlf_2XB-25" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-weight: bolder; box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Figure 5. a&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;, Representative examples of a high-risk (top) and low-risk (bottom) patient predicted by the MICA model in the NLST cohort. For each patient, original H&amp;amp;E images and corresponding virtual CODEX maps for selected biomarkers generated by HEX are shown.&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-weight: bolder; box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;b&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;, Histogram of overall &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;integrated gradient (IG)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt; values across all image patches. Integrated gradient values correspond to the predicted risk scores for each image patch. The high- and low-risk groups are defined by the high and low integrated gradient values.&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-weight: bolder; box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;c&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;, Box plots comparing marker expression distributions between the high- and low-risk groups for selected protein biomarkers (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt; = 26,519 patches in the high-risk group and&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt; = 26,416 patches in the low-risk group). Central lines indicate medians, boxes span the interquartile range (25th–75th percentiles) and whiskers extend to the 5th–95th percentiles. Group differences were evaluated by two-sided Mann–Whitney&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;U&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;-test.&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-weight: bolder; box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;d&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;, Fractions of image tiles with high co-expression values for three pairs of biomarkers (CD3e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;sup style=&quot;vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 12px; line-height: 0; position: relative; top: -0.5em; box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;+&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;/PanCK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;sup style=&quot;vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 12px; line-height: 0; position: relative; top: -0.5em; box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: no